
{"id":"408f95ad-a043-4141-bb30-2c1adf9713e1","object":"chat.completion","created":1785033290,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"import json\\nfrom collections import Counter\\n\\ndef solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    required_symbols = case['required_symbols']\\n    required_set = set(required_symbols)\\n    node_map = {n['id']: n for n in nodes}\\n    children = {n['id']: [] for n in nodes}\\n    root_id = None\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        if n['parent'] is None:\\n            root_id = n['id']\\n        else:\\n            children[n['parent']].append(n['id'])\\n    retained = set(node_map.keys())\\n    required_counts = Counter()\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        if n['symbol'] in required_set:\\n            required_counts[n['symbol']] += 1\\n    sorted_nodes = sorted(nodes, key=lambda n: (-n['depth'], n['id']))\\n    removed = []\\n    for n in sorted_nodes:\\n        nid = n['id']\\n        if nid not in retained:\\n            continue\\n        if nid == root_id or not n['removable']:\\n            continue\\n        has_retained_child = any(c in retained for c in children[nid])\\n        if has_retained_child:\\n            continue\\n        if n['symbol'] in required_set:\\n            if required_counts[n['symbol']] == 1:\\n                continue\\n        removed.append(nid)\\n        retained.remove(nid)\\n        if n['symbol'] in required_set:\\n            required_counts[n['symbol']] -= 1\\n    retained_sorted = sorted(retained)\\n    return {\\\"removed_node_ids\\\": removed, \\\"retained_node_ids\\\": retained_sorted}\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) that takes a payload with nodes and required_symbols. The task is \"grammar_guided_node_reduction\" which is similar to tree pruning or reduction. The output should be an object with removed_node_ids (list of strings, order of removal) and retained_node_ids (list of strings, 